  <reporting-org ref="GB-CHC-285776" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International collaboration for a just and sustainable response to climate change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Down to Earth seeks to act as a &#x201C;bridge&#x201D; between Indonesia and Europe, taking a collaborative approach to working with partners inside and outside Indonesia for capacity-building, information dissemination, translation, and advocacy for environmentally sustainable policies and practices.  Specific areas for research and campaigning are agrofuels and natural resources extraction.  Local communities in Indonesia are supported to defend their livelihoods and resource rights, and to promote sustainable community-based natural resource management systems &#x2013; with a special focus on those which include initiatives to adapt and/  or mitigate climate change.  The partner is an active member of Indonesia&#x2019;s Civil Society Forum on Climate Justice.</narrative>
  </description>
